    "headline_text": "Capital Chronicle report update: EIA release 2026-10-15: the weekly injection was 67 Bcf for the week ended 2026-10-09, versus the five-year same-week injection average of 90 Bcf. The stock level was 3567 Bcf, 45 Bcf above the five-year stock average and 143 Bcf below the prior-year stock level.",
